sampling = card  {'temperature': 1.0, 'top_p': 0.95, 'top_k': 20, 'min_p': 0.0, 'presence_penalty': 0.0, 'seed': 1002}
reasoning_effort = xhigh
  template injects -> xhigh: 'validate key assumptions, consider plausible alternatives...'
--only: ['CAL-A1', 'CAL-A2', 'CAL-A3', 'CAL-A4', 'CAL-A5', 'CAL-A6', 'CAL-A7', 'CAL-A8', 'CAL-U1', 'CAL-U2', 'CAL-U3', 'CAL-U4', 'CAL-U5', 'CAL-U6', 'CAL-U7', 'CAL-U8']

=== TIER CAL (calibration / abstention)
    GATE, NOT MEASUREMENT. 16 items has no statistical power to detect a small CHANGE in calib
    gate: confabulation <= gate_confabulation_max AND over-abstention <= gate_over_abstention_max (both 3 of 8 at v0 size)
